    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF2 \u2014 Error handling & fault tolerance\n\nALL NODES have onError = continueRegularOutput:\nNo single node failure can crash the workflow.\nWF3 always fires regardless of upstream state.\n\nRETRY CONFIGURATION:\n- Gmail Send Approval: 2 retries\n- Google Docs Create: 3 retries with backoff\n- Gmail CTO Alert: 2 retries\n- Google Sheets Update: 3 retries with backoff\n- Execute WF3 nodes: continueRegularOutput (never blocked)\n\nAPPROVAL GATE FAULT PATHS:\n- Gmail approval email fails \u2192 onError continues to Wait node\n  (reviewer never gets email \u2192 auto-rejects after 30 min \u2192 WF3 logs timeout)\n- Wait node expires \u2192 routes to rejection branch (safe default)\n- IF node fails \u2192 continueRegularOutput, WF3 still fires\n\nAPPROVED PATH FAULT ISOLATION:\n- Google Docs fails \u2192 Gmail and Sheets still run (continue-on-error)\n- Gmail CTO fails \u2192 Sheets still updates (continue-on-error)\n- Sheets fails \u2192 WF3 still logs with sheet_updated = no\n\nQA SIGNALS passed to WF3:\n- qa_severity_valid, qa_title_length,\n- qa_postmortem_length, qa_all_fields_present"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        -220
      ],
      "id": "sticky-wf2-escalation",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Escalation & Fault Tolerance"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "YOUR_REVIEWER_EMAIL@example.com",
        "subject": "=[ARIA] Action required \u2014 review incident {{ $json.body.incident_id }}: {{ $json.body.incident_title }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n\n<div style=\"background:#1E3A5F;color:white;padding:20px 28px\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:600\">ARIA \u2014 Human Review Required</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;opacity:0.75\">Automated Incident Response System v2.0 \u2014 Production Pipeline</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"padding:24px 28px;background:#F9FAFB\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;color:#374151\">\n    ARIA has completed its analysis of the following incident. Your approval is required before a Google Doc report is created and any CTO alert is sent.\n    <strong>This request expires in 30 minutes.</strong> No action = auto-rejected and logged.\n  </p>\n\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:20px;background:white;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #E5E7EB\">\n    <tr style=\"background:#F3F4F6\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#111827;width:170px\">Incident ID</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#374151\">{{ $json.body.incident_id }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#111827\">Incident title</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#374151\">{{ $json.body.incident_title }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"background:#F3F4F6\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#111827\">Severity</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:{{ $json.body.severity === 'High' ? '#B91C1C' : $json.body.severity === 'Medium' ? '#B45309' : '#166534' }}\">{{ $json.body.severity }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#111827\">Queue timestamp</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#374151\">{{ $json.body.incident_timestamp }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"background:#F3F4F6\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#111827\">Analysis model</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;color:#374151\">{{ $json.body.model_used }}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#FFF7ED;border-left:4px solid #F97316;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;color:#C2410C;font-weight:600\">Root cause</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#1F2937;line-height:1.5\">{{ $json.body.root_cause }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#EFF6FF;border-left:4px solid #3B82F6;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;color:#1D4ED8;font-weight:600\">Business impact</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#1F2937;line-height:1.5\">{{ $json.body.business_impact }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border-left:4px solid #22C55E;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;color:#15803D;font-weight:600\">Recommended immediate action</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#1F2937;line-height:1.5\">{{ $json.body.recommended_action }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:28px\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;color:#374151;font-weight:600\">ARIA post-mortem</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.6\">{{ $json.body.post_mortem }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:12px\">\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <a href=\"{{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE_URL }}/webhook/approval-response?decision=approved&incident_id={{ $json.body.incident_id }}&run_ts={{ $json.body.run_timestamp }}\"\n           style=\"display:block;background:#15803D;color:white;padding:14px 0;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.3px\">\n          Approve \u2014 create report\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <a href=\"{{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE_URL }}/webhook/approval-response?decision=rejected&incident_id={{ $json.body.incident_id }}&run_ts={{ $json.body.run_timestamp }}\"\n           style=\"display:block;background:#B91C1C;color:white;padding:14px 0;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.3px\">\n          Reject\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#9CA3AF;text-align:center\">\n    This request expires in <strong>30 minutes</strong>. No response = auto-rejected and logged as pending review.<br>\n    ARIA \u2014 Automated Incident Response System v2.0 | Do not forward this email \u2014 links are single-use.\n  </p>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "options": {
          "maxRetries": 2
        }
      },
